      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To ensure thorough documentation, I recommend keeping a detailed record of each step in the progressive discipline process. This should include:\n\n- A date and time of the verbal warning\n- The specific issue(s) discussed\n- Observations, facts, and evidence supporting the complaint\n- The agreed-upon plan for improvement\n- Dates and details of any written warnings\n- Incident reports, supporting witness statements, or any other relevant evidence\n\nKeep all documentation in the employee's personnel file, and consider using a company-approved template to ensure consistency and accuracy.",
